{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_0C40A362","title":"Gunger Hahn reveals more info","entry":"Dlg_0C40A362::entry","exit":"Dlg_0C40A362::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_F30A5076","articyId":"72057645577586401","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Hey, I was just thinking about that bottle of Lenuit we stole after Gato's wedding. Did we drink that?","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hey, I was just thinking about that bottle of Lenuit we stole after Gato's wedding. Did we drink that?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":450.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38280","byteOffset":28817728,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_E1E004BE","articyId":"72057645577586422","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"The grape wine. Remember? Gato was keeping it back for when the \"party really got started\", but we swiped it. You said we'd drink it on a birthday.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The grape wine. Remember? Gato was keeping it back for when the \"party really got started\", but we swiped it. You said we'd drink it on a birthday.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1050.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51125","byteOffset":33754400,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_820ED429","articyId":"72057645577586436","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"You drank it, didn't you!? You old criminal. Well, easy come, easy go. Though smuggling it out down my pants wasn't so easy.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You drank it, didn't you!? You old criminal. Well, easy come, easy go. Though smuggling it out down my pants wasn't so easy.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1650.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51686","byteOffset":33968344,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_023080A0","articyId":"72057645577586458","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Stop being weird. You know I can't stand it when you have one of your... episodes. Last time it was stoicism. What now? Existential identity loss?","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Stop being weird. You know I can't stand it when you have one of your... episodes. Last time it was stoicism. What now? Existential identity loss?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":2,"name":"Upset"},"position":{"x":2250.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29624","byteOffset":19087624,"byteLength":492}},{"id":"DFr_04F8FD96","articyId":"72057645577586480","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Your identity as... Thaddeus. No... wait...","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Your identity as... Thaddeus. No... wait...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2850.0,"y":525.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35949","byteOffset":27947792,"byteLength":352}},{"id":"DFr_A2E2808F","articyId":"72057645577586487","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Sure you have. Thaddeus, are you forgetting who you are again? Wait...","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Sure you have. Thaddeus, are you forgetting who you are again? Wait...","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2850.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45447","byteOffset":31526848,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_9019578A","articyId":"72057645577586502","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Your worst indulgence was your obsession with the heat death of the universe. You ate that green mold and told everyone you were hurtling through time, but you'd come back and tell us what happened at the end.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Your worst indulgence was your obsession with the heat death of the universe. You ate that green mold and told everyone you were hurtling through time, but you'd come back and tell us what happened at the end.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3450.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19954","byteOffset":15433544,"byteLength":556}},{"id":"DFr_8BF15BEF","articyId":"72057645577586523","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Huh? Oh, you said the last black dwarf implodes, then explodes in a supernova, and that's the last thing that will ever happen. Though there's other people there. Every time tourist who has an interest in the end of the universe.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Huh? Oh, you said the last black dwarf implodes, then explodes in a supernova, and that's the last thing that will ever happen. Though there's other people there. Every time tourist who has an interest in the end of the universe.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4050.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"17284","byteOffset":14427984,"byteLength":576}},{"id":"DFr_2FAEF7FD","articyId":"72057645577586544","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Right... right... Say, you're not actually Thaddeus are you?","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Right... right... Say, you're not actually Thaddeus are you?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4650.0,"y":275.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22460","byteOffset":16381952,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_9072ABE0","articyId":"72057645577586566","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"No. You're not are you? Sorry. I didn't get a good night's sleep last night and I'm not thinking straight. I'll... I'll see you around.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No. You're not are you? Sorry. I didn't get a good night's sleep last night and I'm not thinking straight. I'll... I'll see you around.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5250.0,"y":625.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36625","byteOffset":28199304,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_0AB9808A","articyId":"72057645577586575","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gunger Hahn","text":"Ha, good one. I'm gonna need to go get a cup of coffee. I didn't sleep much last night. I'll... see you around.","speakerId":"Ntt_6D1840C0","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ha, good one. I'm gonna need to go get a cup of coffee. I didn't sleep much last night. I'll... see you around.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5250.0,"y":150.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44611","byteOffset":31207992,"byteLength":420}},{"id":"DFr_5768FD0B","articyId":"72057645577586414","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"What?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"What?","TextSheVersion":"What?","TextTheyVersion":"What?"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":750.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27067","byteOffset":18119496,"byteLength":288}},{"id":"DFr_982435ED","articyId":"72057645577586429","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I think you're confused.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think you're confused.","TextSheVersion":"I think you're confused.","TextTheyVersion":"I think you're confused."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1350.0,"y":400.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44763","byteOffset":31268368,"byteLength":304}},{"id":"DFr_2C3032B9","articyId":"72057645577586443","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I didn't drink your wine.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I didn't drink your wine.","TextSheVersion":"I didn't drink your wine.","TextTheyVersion":"I didn't drink your wine."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1950.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27816","byteOffset":18405624,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_75B63848","articyId":"72057645577586448","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"Who do you think I am?","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Who do you think I am?","TextSheVersion":"Who do you think I am?","TextTheyVersion":